\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces (a) A reward bit attaches to $\sim $30 categorical decisions in an AR model but is spread over $10^{5}$--$10^{6}$ noise coordinates in a flow language model, whose score is the noise itself; the pathwise gradient replaces it with a deterministic per-coordinate signal from a critic on noisy states. (b) \textsc  {JPC}{}: the 2D critic scores every position $i$ of a random intermediate state $y_k$, its pooled value is the actor's objective, and it is trained on the same rollouts as the policy.}}{6}{figure.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:mechanism}{{1}{6}{(a) A reward bit attaches to $\sim $30 categorical decisions in an AR model but is spread over $10^{5}$--$10^{6}$ noise coordinates in a flow language model, whose score is the noise itself; the pathwise gradient replaces it with a deterministic per-coordinate signal from a critic on noisy states. (b) \jpc {}: the 2D critic scores every position $i$ of a random intermediate state $y_k$, its pooled value is the actor's objective, and it is trained on the same rollouts as the policy}{figure.caption.11}{}}
