\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Main results (accuracy \%) at the deployment sampler ($\gamma 56$@64; $\gamma 28$@32 on Sudoku) and at the cheap 64-step ODE sampler. ELF-B RL rows are means over three seeds of the per-seed peak over evaluated checkpoints, every seed counted (per-seed values in Appendices~\ref {app:details} and~\ref {app:results}); bold: best of the three RL levels (ties within jitter both bold); in the last row, best of the ELF-B block. 2D critic: Algorithm~\ref {alg:jpc}; scalar critic: two-phase $3{\times }10^{-6}\!\to \!10^{-6}$ (on Sudoku every seed peaks below the base and collapses). Loop rows start from the best 2D-critic seed of each task (1 round on Sudoku, 4 on Countdown and Game24, 5 on K\&K; Countdown's rounds 3--4 use the jointly trained 2D critic to guide the pool); the gold-label control uses the same fresh K\&K pools with gold labels. GPT-2: greedy decoding; LLaDA: d1's recipe at 256 tokens (Appendix~\ref {app:d1}). ``--'': not run or in progress.}}{7}{table.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:main}{{1}{7}{Main results (accuracy \%) at the deployment sampler ($\gamma 56$@64; $\gamma 28$@32 on Sudoku) and at the cheap 64-step ODE sampler. ELF-B RL rows are means over three seeds of the per-seed peak over evaluated checkpoints, every seed counted (per-seed values in Appendices~\ref {app:details} and~\ref {app:results}); bold: best of the three RL levels (ties within jitter both bold); in the last row, best of the ELF-B block. 2D critic: Algorithm~\ref {alg:jpc}; scalar critic: two-phase $3{\times }10^{-6}\!\to \!10^{-6}$ (on Sudoku every seed peaks below the base and collapses). Loop rows start from the best 2D-critic seed of each task (1 round on Sudoku, 4 on Countdown and Game24, 5 on K\&K; Countdown's rounds 3--4 use the jointly trained 2D critic to guide the pool); the gold-label control uses the same fresh K\&K pools with gold labels. GPT-2: greedy decoding; LLaDA: d1's recipe at 256 tokens (Appendix~\ref {app:d1}). ``--'': not run or in progress}{table.caption.14}{}}
