\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Frozen versus jointly trained critic on Game24 (2D critic, learning rate $10^{-6}$). Red: the critic's value on the training batch; grey: the true success rate of that batch; blue: held-out accuracy at the deployment sampler. With a frozen critic the value is driven to $\approx 90$ while success collapses to zero; with joint training the value stays calibrated and the policy improves.}}{25}{figure.caption.64}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:frozen}{{6}{25}{Frozen versus jointly trained critic on Game24 (2D critic, learning rate $10^{-6}$). Red: the critic's value on the training batch; grey: the true success rate of that batch; blue: held-out accuracy at the deployment sampler. With a frozen critic the value is driven to $\approx 90$ while success collapses to zero; with joint training the value stays calibrated and the policy improves}{figure.caption.64}{}}
